{"id":"n28357-1-7","stage":2,"title":"다투다 · 争吵","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28357-1-7-1","ko":"기분 나쁜 일이 있었어?","zh":"发生什么不愉快的事了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"기분","meaning":"心情","explanation":"기분：心情","readings":[{"term":"기분","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20192","senseId":"1","lemma":"기분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기분","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3"}},{"text":"나쁜","meaning":"糟糕，不好","explanation":"나쁘다：糟糕，不好；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나쁘다","audio":"/audio/b67c592bde724aa15bfa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26816","senseId":"2","lemma":"나쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나쁜","audio":"/audio/e203b60c1df7f7cc3ba8.mp3"}},{"text":"일이","meaning":"事，事情","explanation":"일：事，事情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"3","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일이","audio":"/audio/deca3bc3889d43a361ec.mp3"}},{"text":"있었어?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있었어","audio":"/audio/7f1221d9d5431e3ca85b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ebafc4e98d6e15e7","term":"기분","zh":"心情","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3","entryId":"20192","definition":"不快、愉快、忧郁、愤怒等的情感状态。","pronunciation":["기분"]},{"id":"b67c592bde724aa1","term":"나쁘다","zh":"糟糕，不好","audio":"/audio/b67c592bde724aa15bfa.mp3","entryId":"26816","definition":"不称心或感觉不太好。","pronunciation":["나쁘다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带有某种内容的情况或事实。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e2644a19afeab1e92132.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28357-1-7-2","ko":"응, 아까 전에 친구와 다퉈서 기분이 안 좋네.","zh":"嗯，刚才和朋友吵架了，心情不太好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚才，方才，刚刚","explanation":"아까：刚才，方才，刚刚","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65974","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}},{"text":"전에","meaning":"以前","explanation":"전：以前；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17301","senseId":"1","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전에","audio":"/audio/2d406c50ea3b8c668815.mp3"}},{"text":"친구와","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；와：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구와","audio":"/audio/c93e8af68adb1e2b77e3.mp3"}},{"text":"다퉈서","meaning":"争吵，吵架","explanation":"다투다：争吵，吵架；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"다투다","audio":"/audio/1ac90a55b60bbcd53c5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28357","senseId":"1","lemma":"다투다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다퉈서","audio":"/audio/acf36a841c3389fa2bc0.mp3"}},{"text":"기분이","meaning":"心情","explanation":"기분：心情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","re